What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the elliptic cone $(x+1)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{6}=(z-1)^{2}\\,?$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358350 1113 #uuid "4d859ee6-f828-506d-b2a6-7efbe3346f4b" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358350 1145 "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the elliptic cone, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+1)^{2}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{6} & =(z-1)^{2} \\\\ (x+1)^{2} & =(z-1)^{2} \\\\ \\pm (x+1) & =z-1 \\\\ z & =\\pm (x+1)+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us two lines in the $xz$-plane with equations $z=-x$ and $z=x+2.$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358352 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358353 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358354 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358355 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358356 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1041 "selection" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1104 #edb/ref 17592186358356 13194139535630 true] [17592186358351 1110 #uuid "b2cbb472-de5f-5adf-a705-50a67dfcb947" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358352 1034 "z=\\pm x+1" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358352 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535630 true] [17592186358352 1111 #uuid "98ad9488-f0f3-59f3-a6fe-5837e8a90116" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358353 1034 "z=-x" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358353 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535630 true] [17592186358353 1111 #uuid "7d58e0fe-29b2-5231-94df-da48ec6ac6c9" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358354 1034 "$z=-x-2,\\,$ $z=-x$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358354 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535630 true] [17592186358354 1111 #uuid "20bc7cb0-2d31-5c85-aceb-46ef1a12734e" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358355 1034 "z=\\pm x-2" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358355 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535630 true] [17592186358355 1111 #uuid "ad600997-cab7-59fb-a5bb-6ece9ab1b40b" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358356 1034 "$z=-x,\\,$ $z=x+2$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358356 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535630 true] [17592186358356 1111 #uuid "fc590fb5-d7a0-5705-936f-881aef7fc854" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358357 1017 #edb/ref 17592186358358 13194139535630 true] [17592186358357 1089 "q-94605" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358357 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535630 true] [17592186358357 1100 "Given the elliptic cone $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}={z}^{2},$ find its intercept with the $z$-axis." 13194139535630 true] [17592186358357 1113 #uuid "44fae6f3-1352-5773-b683-7be2b7277a05" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358357 1145 "To find the $z$-intercept of the elliptic cone, we plug $x=0$ and $y=0$ into the equation and solve for $z:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{0}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{9} & ={z}^{2} \\\\ 0+0 & ={z}^{2} \\\\ {z}^{2} & =0 \\\\ z & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the intercept with the $z$-axis is $(0,0,0)$ only." 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358359 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358360 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358361 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358362 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358363 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1041 "selection" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1104 #edb/ref 17592186358361 13194139535630 true] [17592186358358 1110 #uuid "212e1aac-59ad-53d3-ba77-fdc95dfe2dd3" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358359 1034 "$(0,0,3)$ only" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358359 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535630 true] [17592186358359 1111 #uuid "50e813f2-ff0e-5444-b24d-35fbf57139d3" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358360 1034 "$(0,0,0)$ and $(0,0,3)$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358360 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535630 true] [17592186358360 1111 #uuid "39bb41fa-2935-5219-b051-6a8e275a4ec2" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358361 1034 "$(0,0,0)$ only" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358361 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535630 true] [17592186358361 1111 #uuid "81397cd7-2353-51a1-ba5c-5a2ad2ea786c" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358362 1034 "$(0,0,1)$ only" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358362 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535630 true] [17592186358362 1111 #uuid "b06dd098-9318-5786-8c3a-4a2ddc0fcf94" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358363 1034 "$(0,0,1)$ and $(0,0,9)$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358363 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535630 true] [17592186358363 1111 #uuid "ba5c84d1-9e18-55ae-8530-8c570ca232f6" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358364 1017 #edb/ref 17592186358365 13194139535630 true] [17592186358364 1089 "q-94698" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358364 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535630 true] [17592186358364 1100 "Find the center of the elliptic cone $9(x+3)^{2}+4(y+2)^{2}={z}^{2}.$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358364 1113 #uuid "bcc2e3e3-89bb-5607-9c6a-ce5e59ebb032" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358364 1145 "The general equation of an elliptic cone with center at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-{x}_{0})^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-{y}_{0})^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=\\frac{(z-{z}_{0})^{2}}{{c}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTo find the center, we rewrite our equation in standard form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9(x+3)^{2}+4(y+2)^{2} & =(z-0)^{2} \\\\ \\frac{(x+3)^{2}}{1/9}+\\frac{(y+2)^{2}}{1/4} & =(z-0)^{2} \\\\ \\frac{(x-(-3))^{2}}{1/9}+\\frac{(y-(-2))^{2}}{1/4} & =(z-0)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of an elliptic cone that has its center at $(-3,-2,0).$" 13194139535630 true] [17592186358365 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358366 13194139535630 true] [17592186358365 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358367 13194139535630 true] [17592186358365 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358368 13194139535630 true] [17592186358365 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358369 13194139535630 true] [17592